"""Generated Modal runtime for Omo's deterministic SKILL.md loader.

Generated by __COMPILER_VERSION__. This is a build/analysis service: it parses
untrusted Markdown, compiles a candidate with the canonical compiler, runs
fixture-level checks, and prices from the canonical cost model. It never loads
credentials and never calls a provider.
"""

